This is good talk. To test new LLM, first define what it can do. Make it clear and simple. Then make test set with normal and hard examples. Use computer to score, but also ask people to check. Say how sure you are, not just one number.

Make paper with information about test set. Where data come from, how labeled, and what rules for use. This help others try same thing and see if good for them.

